    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard is the most under utilized game controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;QWERTY Zombies&quot; you kill the zombies that walk on your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate Whack-a-mole experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/3167083bb0636fa3bbcf6ccc506f639b.poster.avif?t=1748207423\" width=800 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/3167083bb0636fa3bbcf6ccc506f639b.webm?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/3167083bb0636fa3bbcf6ccc506f639b.mp4?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay terrain is mapped to the keyboard. Every level introduces new gameplay elements that test your finger dexterity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/41b2aacaa27d464222ba1e00f10099ad.poster.avif?t=1748207423\" width=574 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/41b2aacaa27d464222ba1e00f10099ad.webm?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/41b2aacaa27d464222ba1e00f10099ad.mp4?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some levels require you to master hand-eye coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/fea09ac7895bb08e0d0cef43659bb4b5.poster.avif?t=1748207423\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/fea09ac7895bb08e0d0cef43659bb4b5.webm?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/fea09ac7895bb08e0d0cef43659bb4b5.mp4?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The quirky boss zombies will give you the best experience as you create music out of well-timed keystrokes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level can be replayed to improve your stats and earn trophies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/e70df1df3c68d774ede5709e47d2002e.avif?t=1748207423\" width=620 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The progression map has many forks. You can choose to solve the levels along different paths. Overall progress is guided by the locks and keys that make different paths inter-dependent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is available for you to try. The game is still under development and your feedback is much appreciated. Also join the Discord to engage with the developer and the community.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard is the most under utilized game controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;QWERTY Zombies&quot; you kill the zombies that walk on your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate Whack-a-mole experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/3167083bb0636fa3bbcf6ccc506f639b.poster.avif?t=1748207423\" width=800 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/3167083bb0636fa3bbcf6ccc506f639b.webm?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/3167083bb0636fa3bbcf6ccc506f639b.mp4?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay terrain is mapped to the keyboard. Every level introduces new gameplay elements that test your finger dexterity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/41b2aacaa27d464222ba1e00f10099ad.poster.avif?t=1748207423\" width=574 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/41b2aacaa27d464222ba1e00f10099ad.webm?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/41b2aacaa27d464222ba1e00f10099ad.mp4?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some levels require you to master hand-eye coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/fea09ac7895bb08e0d0cef43659bb4b5.poster.avif?t=1748207423\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/fea09ac7895bb08e0d0cef43659bb4b5.webm?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/fea09ac7895bb08e0d0cef43659bb4b5.mp4?t=1748207423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The quirky boss zombies will give you the best experience as you create music out of well-timed keystrokes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level can be replayed to improve your stats and earn trophies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568720/extras/e70df1df3c68d774ede5709e47d2002e.avif?t=1748207423\" width=620 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The progression map has many forks. You can choose to solve the levels along different paths. Overall progress is guided by the locks and keys that make different paths inter-dependent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is available for you to try. The game is still under development and your feedback is much appreciated. Also join the Discord to engage with the developer and the community.</p>",
    "short_description": "Zombies are walking on the keyboard. Crush them under the keys. A unique action puzzle game that maps the terrain to the keyboard offering a novel combat experience. Stretch your fingers and begin!",
